{{ metadata.locale | where: "key", "note" | map: lang | first }}

{% comment %}
Two columns, filled down the first and then the second: row i holds entry i
and entry i + rows, so every entry prints once and an odd count leaves the
last right cell empty.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign rows = data.size | plus: 1 | divided_by: 2 %}
{% assign last = rows | minus: 1 %}

[cols="4",options="unnumbered"]
|===
{% for i in (0..last) -%}
    {%- assign j = i | plus: rows -%}
    {%- assign column_one = data[i] -%}
    {%- assign column_two = data[j] -%}
    | {{ column_one.number }} | {{ column_one.geographic_area[lang] }}
    | {{ column_two.number }} | {{ column_two.geographic_area[lang] }}
{%- endfor %}
|===

